      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] Using `strtol` for hex values can be problematic if the values exceed the range of `long` (especially on 32-bit systems, though less likely here). For addresses and sizes, `strtoul` or `strtoull` is generally safer as it explicitly handles unsigned values.",
